  SALES_RETURN
  PURCHASE_BILL
  PURCHASE_RETURN
  PAYMENT
  RECEIPT
  EXPENSE
  PAYROLL
  STOCK_ADJUSTMENT
  DEPRECIATION
  MANUAL
  OPENING_BALANCE
  CONTRA
